      "title": "README - read this first",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Abyss whale - 10s, H3 writes the music\n\n**No `LoadAudio`.** The score is decoded from H3's own audio latent, which is what the contest's *'H3-generated synced audio'* asks for.\n\nThe prompt asks for an actual **score** - 80 BPM, 808 on the downbeat, pads, piano, cello, with an arrangement that builds - because describing scene foley got foley. Measured on the 5.2s attempts: the 'percussive' prompt produced *1* onset above 0.5, the plain ambient one produced 16. Naming drums did not make drums.\n\n**The driver is the bass envelope**, not beat detection: `beat_locations` found 2 beats in 5.2s. The rhythm extractor is still here but only as a *measurement* - at 10s there is finally room for a few bars, so check its preview and `FeatureInfo`. If beats show up, promote it to the driver."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
