      "title": "Bass envelope",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Bass envelope - the driver\n\n`lowpass 180Hz` -> `rms_energy` gives the 808's own envelope. On the 5.2s test this band had 30/124 frames above 0.4 while beat detection found 2 beats total, so this is what actually carries signal.\n\n`Smoothing` (exponential 0.45) gives each hit a ring-out so the bioluminescence swells and falls instead of strobing one frame."
      ],
